@startuml
!theme materia

<style>
document {
  BackgroundColor transparent
  `materia wants Verdana, which isn't installed
  FontName sans-serif
}
</style>

title
  =Internal IDP
  ==Stroom is both the Relying Party and the identity provider
end title

actor "User\n(browser)" as browser

box "Stroom" #Transparent
participant "Application" as app
participant "Internal IDP" as idp
end box

database "Accounts" as db

== Signing in ==

browser -> app: GET /
app --> browser: Bootstrap page
browser -> app: GET /api/auth/flow/v1/status
app -> app: No session
app --> browser: 200 {authenticated: false, redirectUrl}\nSets the state and target cookies

browser -> idp: GET /oauth2/v1/auth\nclient_id, redirect_uri, state,\nnonce, code_challenge (S256)
idp --> browser: Sign in screen
browser -> idp: User id and password
idp -> db: Check the account and password
db --> idp: Account state
note right of idp
  A locked or disabled account is
  refused without the password
  being checked at all
end note
idp --> browser: 302 to the redirect_uri\nwith an authorization code

browser -> app: GET /api/auth/flow/v1/signin-oidc\ncode, state
app -> app: The state must match\nthe cookie set above
app -> idp: POST /oauth2/v1/token\ncode, code_verifier, client_id, clientSecret
idp -> idp: Mint and sign an ID token\nwith the current signing key
idp --> app: ID token and access token
app -> idp: GET /oauth2/v1/certs (cached)
idp --> app: Public signing keys
app -> app: Verify signature, issuer,\naudience and nonce
app --> browser: 302 to the original page,\nsets the session cookie

== Afterwards ==

browser -> app: GET /api/... (session cookie)
app --> browser: Response

@enduml
